OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers' pride at King's Award
OL,4,Ahonours
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent lifeboat and food
OL,7,Fredistribution charity are among those
OL,8,Fin the south of England who have
OL,9,Freceived the highest award a voluntary
OL,10,Fgroup can receive in the UK.
OL,12,FThe King's Award for Voluntary Service
OL,13,F(KAVS) recognises a variety of
OL,14,Fvolunteer-led organisations in areas
OL,15,Fincluding mental health support, youth
OL,16,Fservices, environmental projects and
OL,17,Fcommunity initiatives.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
