OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers' pride at King's Award
OL,4,Ahonours
OL,5,
OL,6,FGosport and Fareham Inshore Rescue
OL,7,FService (GAFIRS) was involved in almost
OL,8,F100 rescues off the Hampshire coast
OL,9,Flast year and chair Joanne Young said
OL,10,Fits volunteers were "incredibly proud"
OL,11,Fat being awarded the honour.
OL,13,FThe Share Wokingham charity was also
OL,14,Frecognised for its work redistributing
OL,15,Fsurplus food to more than 2,000
OL,16,Findividuals across Berkshire each week.
